# ==============================================================================
# LOCAL DEVELOPMENT WITHOUT GCP
# ==============================================================================
# For local development (config.settings.local), you only need:
# - DJANGO_SECRET_KEY (above)
# - Local PostgreSQL database credentials (see config/settings/local.py)
# - Optionally: Dropbox credentials if you need to test Dropbox integration
#
# The following GCP-related variables are OPTIONAL for local development.
# They are only needed if you want to test GCP-dependent features:
# - GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT (for Datastore, Secret Manager)
# - MEGADETECTOR_URL, SPECIES_DETECTOR_URL (for ML inference)
# - GS_MODELS_BUCKET_NAME (for model storage)
# - GS_BUCKET_NAME_* (for cloud storage)
# - GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY (for maps)
#
# Local settings use local file storage (media/ directory) instead of GCS.
# ML inference and Datastore features will error if attempted without GCP setup.

# ==============================================================================
# GCP CONFIGURATION (Required for prod/staging/dev, optional for local)
# ==============================================================================
